Agent Registry Framework

EN: The scheduler and SQL schema were extracted and adapted from the local
commerce-multi-agent-demo extension within a commerce-agents source tree.
The extraction replaces commerce-specific task creation, capability names,
chat persistence and worker execution with generic contracts. Registration,
transactional dispatch, leases, attempt fencing, quotas and shared facts
retain their original implementation lineage. New HTTP, worker and validation
modules were written for this extraction. No Anthropic model SDK code is bundled.

中文：调度器及 SQL 表结构提炼自 commerce-agents 源码树中的本地
commerce-multi-agent-demo 扩展。此次提炼将电商任务生成、固定能力、聊天存储和
业务执行替换为通用契约，保留注册、事务派发、租约、尝试隔离、配额及共享事实的
实现来源。HTTP、Worker 和校验模块为本次提炼编写，未打包 Anthropic 模型 SDK 代码。

